        "# SAVRec V7 \u2014 Final Reproducible Experiment\n",
        "\n",
        "This is the cleaned public experiment notebook for the journal submission.\n",
        "It contains only the final benchmark construction used by V7, final model\n",
        "definitions, final reference-faithful baselines, frozen ablations, robustness\n",
        "evaluation, significance analysis, and exploratory mechanism analysis.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Important protocol note:** the historical V6 test split had been inspected\n",
        "during earlier development. The final V7 architecture/hyperparameter selection\n",
        "uses validation only, but the test split should not be described as an untouched\n",
        "or sealed holdout.\n"
      ]
    },
    {
