# ==============================================================================
# CELL 40 — EXPLORATORY VALIDATION GATE CASE STUDY
# ==============================================================================
#
# Purpose
# -------
# Provide three deterministic validation examples illustrating low, median,
# and high values of SAVRec's learned evidence-guided visual gate.
#
# Selection rule
# --------------
# Choose the validation target pairs nearest to the:
#   - 10th percentile of the three-seed mean gate
#   - 50th percentile of the three-seed mean gate
#   - 90th percentile of the three-seed mean gate
#
# IMPORTANT
# ---------
# - Exploratory/post-hoc analysis.
# - VALIDATION ONLY.
# - NO model training.
# - NO checkpoint modification.
# - NO test metric computation.
# - NO manual case selection / cherry-picking.
# - Uses already-saved Cell-39 gate values if the notebook state is unavailable.
#
# ==============================================================================

